From 3aee81c2ac785415ebf27226110e860d77b15b16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 21:37:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 06968/11362] Task 10 follow-on: wire object_hash
 change-history bonus into action_prior via ObjectHistorySaliencePrior
 (REQ-ARC-FCP-5591-2)

Builds the live-consuming mechanism task 10's own DONE note deferred as "a
distinct, separately-scoped design + empirical-validation step": preferring
a click candidate on an object (identified by translation-invariant
object_hash) that has previously been observed to change the frame, over an
untested or reliably-inert one.

ObjectHistorySaliencePrior wraps ColorBlobSaliencePrior (mirroring the
existing GeometricSaliencePrior precedent) and adds a per-object_hash
(obs, changed) tally, updated via observe_transition and consumed via score.
Unlike InertClickSigPruner's wiring (task 9), no new hook call sites were
needed in arc_competition_agent.py: action_prior is already a generic,
externally-composable slot, and _ingest's existing hasattr-gated
observe_transition/reset hooks and _candidates' existing action_prior.score
consumption dispatch to the wrapper automatically once E3AgentPolicy wraps
action_prior with it -- confirmed directly (a real _ingest-driven transition
populates the wrapper's tally with zero new arc_competition_agent.py hook
code).

Gated OFF by default (SUBMITTED_OBJECT_HISTORY_SALIENCE_ENABLED = False,
mirrored in SUBMITTED_AGENT_CONFIG), matching every other
freshly-wired-but-unvalidated component -- flipping it on needs its own
matched-budget offline A/B first, per the solve_rate_dropped guardrail.

20 new unit tests (evidence floor, change-rate polarity and proportionality,
an adversarial degeneracy check confirming the bonus differentiates
same-base-tier candidates by history alone, reset/for_path contract parity)
plus 8 new live-wiring tests (default-off parity, opt-in wrapping of both the
default and an externally-supplied action_prior, direct-instance passthrough,
real _ingest dispatch for both observe_transition and level-up reset). 63
related tests across inert-click-pruner/submitted-parity/color-blob/HUD-mask
still pass unchanged.

Also adds experiment_5601 (not yet run): an offline-sim prototype mirroring
exp5591/exp5595's real-game pattern (m0r0, confirmed click-heavy), measuring
whether the tally accumulates non-degenerate change-rate evidence from real
clicks -- the empirical-validation half of the Phase Prototype discipline
task 10's note named. This is a measurement script, not a live-path flip.

